hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1055","Tha'laba ibn Abi Malik al-Qurazi reported that he rode to 'Abdullah\nibn Suwayd"
"1056","'A'isha said"
"1057","Umm Habiba bint Qays (Khawla) was heard to say"
"1058","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar said"
"1059","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1060","Regarding the ayat"
"1061","Ibn 'Umar reported that when his children had reached puberty\nand he had withdrawn to his room"
"1062","'Alqama said"
"1063","Muslim ibn Nadhir said"
"1064","Musa ibn Talha said"
"1065","Jabir said"
"1066","before the Dawn Prayer and when you have undressed at noon and after the\nNight Prayer - three times of nakedness for you.' (24:56) Ibn 'Abbas\nsaid"
"1067","'Abdullah said"
"1068","'Ubayd ibn 'Umayr reported that Abu Musa al-Ash'ari asked permission\nof 'Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1069","Regarding the person who asks for permission to enter before he\ngives the greeting"
"1070","Abu Hurayra said"
"1071","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1072","Anas said"
"1073","Sahl ibn Sa'd told him that a man looked from a room through the\ndoor of the Prophet"
"1074","The Prophet"
"1075","Anas said"
"1076","'Ubayd ibn Hunayn related to him that Abu Musa said"
"1077","'Abdullah said"
"1078","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1079","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1080","Abu'l-'Alaniyya said"
"1081","'Abdullah ibn Busr"
"1082","Mu'awiya ibn Hudayj said"
"1083","Anas ibn Malik reported that people knocked on the door of the\nProphet"
"1084","Kalda ibn Hanbal reported that Safwan ibn Umayya sent him to the\nProphet"
"1085","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1086","'Ata' reported that Abu Hurayra said"
"1087","Rib'i ibn Hirash reported that a man of the Banu 'Amir came to\nthe Prophet"
"1088","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1089","Jabir said"
"1090","Burayda said"
"1091","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Ju'dan said"
"1092","Abu Hurayra said"
"1093","Muslim ibn Nadhir said"
"1094","Anas ibn Malik reported that a bedouin came to the house of the\nMessenger of Allah"
"1095","'Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1096","Thawban"
"1097","if they live"
"1098","Jabir said"
"1099","Jabir reported that the Prophet"
"1100","A'yan al-Khwarizmi said"
"1101","Mujahid said"
"1102","'Ata' said"
"1103","Abu Abdul Malik"
"1104","Abu 'Uthman an-Nahdi said"
"1105","Abu Basra al-Ghifari reported that the Prophet"
